  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum Mod。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"模组简介\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>命名牌改进对游戏中命名牌物品进行了一些调整。带有自定义名称的生物死亡时会掉落其命名牌。新增了一条命令，无需铁砧即可修改命名牌的值。该模组还增加了一个合成配方。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖关系\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"已包含于原版体验整合包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"已包含于 Serilum 额外捆绑包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>droppedNameTagbyEntityKeepsNameValue</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，任何生物死亡时掉落的命名牌将保留其命名值。<br><br><span><strong>enableNameTagCommand</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，添加 /nametag &lt;名称&gt; 命令。用于无需铁砧即可修改命名值。<br><br><span><strong>nameTagCommandReplaceUnderscoresWithSpaces</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，使用 /nametag 命令时会将下划线替换为空格。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>合成配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"288\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>/nametag &lt;名称&gt; 命令：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"439\" height=\"118\"><span><br><strong>以及结果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"220\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>此处可见一只已命名的猪在死亡时掉落其命名牌：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，但下载链接需保持设在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
